<title>KAZAKHSTAN: TABLE-Kazakhstan sells 500 mln tenge bills Aug 25.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kazakhstan sells 500 mln tenge bills Aug 25.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 500 million tenge of 12-month MKM discount Treasury bills on August 25, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Full details of issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ4CK2708980</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   500 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    364 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     Aug 25</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Aug 27, 1998</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509 410</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
